\"on|strong=\"H5921\"them|strong=\"H1992\".   \n"},{"number":17,"text":"“You|strong=\"H3588\"shall|strong=\"H5971\"say|strong=\"H1697\"this|strong=\"H2088\"word|strong=\"H1697\"to|strong=\"H3381\"them|strong=\"H3381\":  \n“‘Let|strong=\"H3381\"my|strong=\"H3588\"eyes|strong=\"H5869\"run|strong=\"H3381\"down|strong=\"H3381\"with|strong=\"H1697\"tears|strong=\"H1832\"night|strong=\"H3915\"and|strong=\"H1419\"day|strong=\"H3119\",  \nand|strong=\"H1419\"let|strong=\"H3381\"them|strong=\"H3381\"not|strong=\"H2088\"cease|strong=\"H1820\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"virgin|strong=\"H1330\"daughter|strong=\"H1323\"of|strong=\"H1323\"my|strong=\"H3588\"people|strong=\"H5971\"is|strong=\"H2088\"broken|strong=\"H7665\"with|strong=\"H1697\"a|strong=\"H3068\"great|strong=\"H1419\"breach|strong=\"H7667\",  \nwith|strong=\"H1697\"a|strong=\"H3068\"very|strong=\"H3966\"grievous|strong=\"H2470\"wound|strong=\"H4347\".   \n"},{"number":18,"text":"If|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"go|strong=\"H3318\"out|strong=\"H3318\"into|strong=\"H3318\"the|strong=\"H3588\"field|strong=\"H7704\",  \nthen|strong=\"H3318\"behold|strong=\"H2009\", the|strong=\"H3588\"slain|strong=\"H2491\"with|strong=\"H3045\"the|strong=\"H3588\"sword|strong=\"H2719\"!  \nIf|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"enter into|strong=\"H3318\"the|strong=\"H3588\"city|strong=\"H5892\",  \nthen|strong=\"H3318\"behold|strong=\"H2009\", those|strong=\"H3318\"who|strong=\"H3548\"are|strong=\"H5892\"sick|strong=\"H8463\"with|strong=\"H3045\"famine|strong=\"H7458\"!  \nFor|strong=\"H3588\"both|strong=\"H1571\"the|strong=\"H3588\"prophet|strong=\"H5030\"and|strong=\"H3548\"the|strong=\"H3588\"priest|strong=\"H3548\"go|strong=\"H3318\"about|strong=\"H3045\"in|strong=\"H5892\"the|strong=\"H3588\"land|strong=\"H7704\",  \nand|strong=\"H3548\"have|strong=\"H3045\"no|strong=\"H3808\"knowledge|strong=\"H3045\".’”   \n"},{"number":19,"text":"Have|strong=\"H3063\"you|strong=\"H5221\"utterly|strong=\"H3988\"rejected|strong